# Dev-only overrides for the backend sidecar.
#
# Precedence is explicit and must stay that way:
#     CLI args (passed by Tauri at spawn)  >  process env  >  this file
#
# A stale value here must never shadow what Rust passes at spawn — that is the
# "works in dev, wrong in prod" bug class this ordering exists to prevent.
#
# Copy to `.env` to use. `.env` is gitignored; this template is not.

# Force a fixed port instead of letting the backend bind port 0.
# The resolved port is still reported on the @@OOS control line either way.
# OOS_PORT=8756

# Override the log level. Tauri passes --log-level, which wins over this.
# OOS_LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
